      "id": "claim_0e03052e0e63456cb1bdd854fec1726f",
      "statement": "When CF_AI_GATEWAY is set, every provider routes through the platform AI Gateway (Workers AI included); the WORKERS_AI binding is the transport whenever present unless CF_AI_GATEWAY_USE_BINDING=false, because binding requests are pre-authenticated in-account but only reach gateways in the Worker's own account — cross-account deployments opt out via the flag, which is why it is a flag rather than an unbinding: the binding also backs webFetch's toMarkdown conversion; CF_AI_GATEWAY_API_TOKEN is required without the binding and always required for the google provider, whose pi adapter refuses a custom fetch.",
